d in a theme park is shown in the coordinate plane as the region $R$ with vertices $ABCD.$ A path for visitors lies on the line $l$ with equation $-3x+y+1=0.$ The area of the playground is $15\\,{\\text{m}}^{2}.$" :multistep/id #uuid "bf218521-b8fb-5a32-a51b-76467b08fbe3" :multistep/steps [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186607662 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186607611}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186607673 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186607597}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186607677 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186607625}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186607692 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186607568}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186607695 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186607610}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186607713 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186607632}}]}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186613733 :multistep/context "![](images/71/712712e76e27ffc6c47275add1ea473ab0c1c6c5bf450263c6acc2feddb06f85.png)\n\nA farmer's field is shown in the coordinate plane as the region $R$ with vertices $ABCD.$ A dirt track for a tractor lies on the line $l$ with equation $2x+y-5=0.$ The area of the field is $12\\,{\\text{km}}^{2}.$" :multistep/id #uuid "423c2f6f-da88-51e0-aab7-fdb1410bfe2c" :multistep/steps [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186613827 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186613799}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186613830 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186613806}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186613855 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186613781}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186613859 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186613801}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186613865 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186613779}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186613871 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186613762}}]}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186615359 :multistep/context "Consider the initial value problem \n\n$$\n{y}^{′}=\\frac{x}{y},\\,y(0)=1.\n$$" :multistep/id #uuid "0f21b255-fc95-5aad-8c93-8ce15d64b1fa" :multistep/steps [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186615477 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186615373}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186615480 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186615466}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186615495 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186615365}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186615504 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186615469}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186615507 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186615416}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186615524 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186615433}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186615541 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186615390}}]}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186615360 :multistep/context "Mary's house is located $960$ meters from the community park. The following graph shows Mary's distance from home when she walks home from the park.\n\n![](images/73/733489f3198f4b26719b2ad770eae3d965f8f008f4a8171ae67c837af68436e0.png)" :multistep/id #uuid "292580d6-d667-5242-9db2-27de8830a7d4" :multistep/steps [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186615473 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186615439}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186615481 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186615462}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186615490 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186615415}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186615501 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186615386}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186615515 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186615385}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186615518 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186615441}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186615528 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186615453}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186615548 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186615366}}]}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186617768 :multistep/context "Let $s(t)$ represent the number of subscribers to a learning platform at time $t,$ in days, since the moment when the platform was launched. The number of subscribers increases at a rate equal to twice the square of the number of subscribers." :multistep/id #uuid "5aaee881-4178-5ac2-9360-c1c6ada590a5" :multistep/steps [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186617875 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186617813}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186617879 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186617858}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186617893 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186617850}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186617901 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186617820}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186617913 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186617829}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186617921 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186617845}}]}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186621801 :multistep/context "Anthony, Olivia, and Betsy are fishing on one side of a riverbank. A cow and a donkey are drinking on the other side of the river. The situation is sketched below, where $A,$ $O,$ $B,$ $C,$ and $D$ represent Anthony, Olivia, Betsy, the cow, and the donkey, respectively. Olivia lies on the line between Anthony and Betsy, and the angle between Betsy and the donkey from Olivia's point of view is ${50}^{∘}.$ The lines $\\overset{↔}{AB}$ and $\\overset{↔}{CD}$ are parallel.\n\n![](images/80/80389d62289bb4b02d3be573067117bcebd9756d8e12c080cdbd6e23b18d2196.png)" :multistep/id #uuid "5863ef8b-2fb0-5704-a38b-dd930460159d" :multistep/steps [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186621934 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186621895}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186621943 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186621864}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186621945 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186621847}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186621960 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186621832}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186621966 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186621809}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186621982 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186621863}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186621983 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186621845}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186621997 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186621901}}]}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186622750 :multistep/context "Margaret and her friends are preparing to play a tabletop role-playing game (TTRPG). When selecting his character, Margaret chose to be a witch." :multistep/id #uuid "7bbf466e-ad92-551b-b2f2-f09823a5d2df" :multistep/steps [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186622846 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186622799}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186622857 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186622778}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186622871 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186622786}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186622872 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186622758}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186622875 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186622789}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186622881 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186622776}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186622887 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186622754}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186622890 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186622801}}]}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186623620 :multistep/context "Let $p(t)$ represent the profit, in thousands of dollars, of a company at time $t,$ in years, since the moment when the company was founded. The profit increases at a rate that is equal to $3$ times the reciprocal of the natural exponential of the profit." :multistep/id #uuid "3bdc8e25-b0e6-5a24-adc0-682f5b1e89ba" :multistep/steps [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186623701 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186623700}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186623710 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186623663}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186623736 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186623674}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186623739 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186623656}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186623745 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186623635}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186623754 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186623673}}]}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186625491 :multistep/context "Chelsea and Alessandro decide to play with a $4$-sided die. The game involves throwing the die, and whoever gets the highest number wins.\n\nThey decide to extend the game and make it so that the winner of each round receives $\\$3$ from the loser. So, for example, if Chelsea rolls the number $3$ and Alessandro rolls the number $4,$ then Chelsea pays $\\$3$ to Alessandro.\n\nChelsea uses the following table to represent the money she could earn or lose after a round.\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"10\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"4\">Alessandro</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" width=\"30\"><b> $1$</b></td>\n<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" width=\"30\"><b> $2$</b></td>\n<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" width=\"30\"><b> $3$</b></td>\n<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" width=\"30\"><b> $4$</b></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" rowspan=\"4\">Chelsea</td>\n<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\"><b> $1$</b></td>\n<td align=\"center\">$0$</td>\n<td align=\"center\">$-3$</td>\n<td align=\"center\">$-3$</td>\n<td align=\"center\">$-3$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\"><b> $2$</b></td>\n<td align=\"center\">$3$</td>\n<td align=\"center\">$0$</td>\n<td align=\"center\">$-3$</td>\n<td align=\"center\">$-3$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" width=\"30\"><b> $3$</b></td>\n<td align=\"center\">$3$</td>\n<td align=\"center\">$3$</td>\n<td align=\"center\">$0$</td>\n<td align=\"center\">$-3$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" width=\"30\"><b>$4$</b></td>\n<td align=\"center\">$3$</td>\n<td align=\"center\">$3$</td>\n<td align=\"center\">$3$</td>\n<td align=\"center\">$0$</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>" :multistep/id #uuid "f5605289-be23-5239-9aea-e65fe1ba130b" :multistep/steps [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186625623 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186625547}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186625633 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186625515}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186625636 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186625550}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186625640 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186625571}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186625647 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186625604}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186625651 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186625535}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186625657 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186625511}}]}]}
